==Restrictions==
*Fixed lineup: [[Cat (Normal Cat)|Macho Cat]], [[Moneko (Special Cat)|Miss Moneko]] and [[Jurassic Cat (Rare Cat)|Jurassic Cat Sitter]].

==Battleground==
*The enemy base here is a [[Catclaw Castle (Enemy Base)|Catclaw Castle]].
*1 [[Metal Hippoe]] spawns as the boss after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 23.33~26.67 seconds<sup>700f~800f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage introduces the Metal trait: a trait in which the enemies take only 1 damage from all attacks except critical attacks.

You are supplied with multiple critical attackers, [[Moneko (Special Cat)|Miss Moneko]] and [[Jurassic Cat (Rare Cat)|Jurassic Cat]]. While Moneko isn't very spammable, Jurassic Cat is. Keep sending out both and you'll win once one of them lands a crit.

==Hints==
The first hint can be viewed within the Enemies Appearing window before beginning the stage. The second only appears as a defeat message when failing it.
*Machine-like Metal enemies<br>take very little damage.<br>To deal with them, deploy units with the<br>{{Color|Blue|Critical}} ability.
*Deploy Macho Cat to protect<br>Miss MONEKO and<br>Jurassic Cat Sitter!

